WEBVTT

00:43.793 --> 00:48.214
DOONA!

02:47.584 --> 02:50.211
EPISODE 5
MEANINGLESS KISS

03:24.662 --> 03:26.456
- Oh, hey.
- Hi.

03:26.539 --> 03:29.751
Hope you weren't waiting too long.
Sorry it took so long.

03:29.834 --> 03:31.794
Hey, I gotta run, guys. See you.

03:51.314 --> 03:52.232
Oh, you're here.

03:57.445 --> 03:59.572
Hey, um, could we talk for a second?

04:02.325 --> 04:03.159
Okay.

04:03.701 --> 04:04.535
Go ahead.

04:11.751 --> 04:12.752
What did you wanna say?

04:19.509 --> 04:20.760
Did I touch you?

04:21.386 --> 04:22.220
Sorry.

04:24.305 --> 04:25.765
Why did you do that yesterday?

04:25.848 --> 04:26.808
Do what?

04:29.852 --> 04:30.728
Ah.

04:31.980 --> 04:33.273
Right, we kissed yesterday.

04:37.151 --> 04:37.986
I just did it.

04:39.112 --> 04:40.488
What other reason is there?

04:41.656 --> 04:43.825
Why? Wasn't the kiss good?

04:48.413 --> 04:49.539
Do you like me?

04:50.957 --> 04:52.166
Or do you not at all?

04:57.005 --> 04:58.673
Obviously you don't, then.

04:59.716 --> 05:01.926
Listen, Doona, I don't kiss friends.

05:03.136 --> 05:04.178
So if we could

05:05.388 --> 05:07.932
just keep things platonic from now on,
that'd be great.

05:08.975 --> 05:11.227
I know that you've been lonely here, and

05:12.020 --> 05:14.314
you've been longing for some comfort
to help cope with that.

05:14.397 --> 05:15.732
I totally understand.

05:16.274 --> 05:18.401
But that can lead to a misunderstanding.

05:19.027 --> 05:20.611
And you can get hurt in the end.

05:22.405 --> 05:23.239
Hey.

05:24.657 --> 05:26.451
You're really not much fun at all.

05:27.243 --> 05:30.163
You're only 21.
Why take everything so seriously?

05:33.333 --> 05:35.418
I didn't say I was looking for love.

05:35.501 --> 05:36.961
The kiss gave me butterflies.

05:41.007 --> 05:43.843
And I don't want to feel that way
over nothing, all right?

05:45.595 --> 05:47.347
It's okay to feel like that.

05:48.264 --> 05:50.016
Everyone does at first,
then gets over it.

05:50.600 --> 05:52.643
You won't be any different, all right?

06:20.505 --> 06:24.467
SEEKING FEMALE ROOMMATE
FOR FIRST FLOOR OF SHARED HOUSE

06:37.647 --> 06:40.024
Excuse me! Could you hold the elevator?

06:40.108 --> 06:41.109
Excuse me!

06:42.318 --> 06:43.903
Wait, wait, wait! Hold on a sec!

06:45.196 --> 06:46.614
Oh, thanks, guys!

06:47.198 --> 06:49.450
- Yikes, I'm sorry. Thank you.
- Ah, what is this?

06:49.534 --> 06:51.327
- Why didn't you just wait for the next?
- Oh.

06:52.578 --> 06:55.998
Oh! Oh! Oh! Oh!
The kissing king! The kissing king!

06:56.082 --> 06:58.459
- Samba girl?
- Yes, yes, yes, yes, hi!

06:58.543 --> 07:00.545
- It's me, the samba girl, yes!
- Ah!

07:00.628 --> 07:03.256
- Hey, this is so crazy!
- Are you headed to class or what?

07:03.339 --> 07:04.465
Oh, actually, no.

07:04.549 --> 07:07.593
Uh, I'll contact you later, and, uh…
and I'll let you know later, okay?

07:07.677 --> 07:09.137
- Okay.
- Oh, but anyways, I better run.

07:09.220 --> 07:10.930
- Oh, okay.
- Thanks so much.

07:15.518 --> 07:18.146
Can I maybe stay
at your place for a few nights?

07:18.229 --> 07:19.439
I gotta run.

07:20.231 --> 07:21.858
Wait, baby, don't go.

07:21.941 --> 07:24.527
You piece of trash! Get away from me!

07:26.737 --> 07:29.157
What am I supposed to do now?

07:29.240 --> 07:30.199
Hey.

07:32.702 --> 07:34.954
So, yesterday,
I was booted out of my dorm.

07:35.037 --> 07:36.998
Won't you help out a former girlfriend?

07:45.882 --> 07:47.675
So, about what you
asked me the other day--

07:47.758 --> 07:50.303
When I… told you
that I have strong feelings for you?

07:51.679 --> 07:52.680
Yes.

07:53.264 --> 07:55.266
I'm ready to give my answer to you.

07:55.349 --> 07:59.562
You can take your time to think about it.
I have a feeling you won't.

08:00.688 --> 08:02.732
I have feelings for someone else, Se-hun.

08:05.276 --> 08:07.904
- I apologize if I gave you any mixed--
- It's Won-jun, right?

08:07.987 --> 08:08.821
Huh?

08:12.909 --> 08:14.952
For the record,
you never gave mixed signals.

08:15.036 --> 08:17.121
I always knew the truth.
I just ignored it.

08:17.830 --> 08:18.915
Um, well,

08:19.707 --> 08:21.000
I'm sorry, Se-hun.

08:23.085 --> 08:25.171
LITERARY SOCIETY
SPARK

08:45.233 --> 08:46.859
MOVING OUT? YOU'RE PENNILESS.

08:46.943 --> 08:49.362
COME HOME,
OR I WON'T SUPPORT YOU EVER AGAIN

08:52.865 --> 08:55.576
I'M IN THE PARKING LOT
GET OVER HERE AS SOON AS YOU'RE DONE

08:55.660 --> 08:58.120
HAVE YOU FINALLY LOST IT?
HOW DARE YOU IGNORE MY CALLS?

08:58.204 --> 09:01.249
MOM SAYS YOU WORK PART-TIME. STUDY MORE.
DON'T HANG OUT LIKE A SLUT. REPLY!

09:08.881 --> 09:15.888
GOODBYE

09:18.808 --> 09:21.561
DAD
BLOCK CONTACT

09:32.613 --> 09:33.823
Won-jun, hey.

09:49.422 --> 09:51.966
What is this place? It's pretty.

09:52.049 --> 09:53.259
Oh, there you are.

09:53.759 --> 09:55.219
Come over here for a second, hmm?

09:56.721 --> 09:58.806
Look, you can see your place
from this angle.

09:59.682 --> 10:01.934
I never knew
the Humanities Department had a roof deck.

10:02.018 --> 10:04.520
There are many things
you don't know about.

10:12.153 --> 10:13.654
What are you thinking about?

10:13.738 --> 10:15.781
It's just, um,

10:15.865 --> 10:19.577
there are so many buildings out there,
but not one belongs to me.

10:19.660 --> 10:21.454
I guess we're alike.

10:21.537 --> 10:23.039
Uh… in that regard, no we're not.

10:26.250 --> 10:27.877
What makes you say that?

10:28.461 --> 10:29.920
I didn't mean anything, just…

10:30.796 --> 10:33.507
I just didn't think you had much
to worry about growing up, is all.

10:35.760 --> 10:37.053
Um, Jin-ju…

10:39.972 --> 10:42.391
I guess you don't know me
as well as you think you do.

10:52.318 --> 10:54.236
What's wrong, Jin-ju? What is it?

10:54.820 --> 10:57.531
Was there something I was mistaken about?
I don't get it.

11:11.921 --> 11:12.922
I'm sorry.

11:16.008 --> 11:18.386
This isn't what I
wanted to talk about today.

11:19.303 --> 11:21.472
I'm so annoying, jeez.

12:07.393 --> 12:09.520
Won-Jun, don't drift too far away, okay?

12:12.523 --> 12:14.859
That's what I wanted to say to you
up on the roof.

12:15.693 --> 12:17.570
Don't let anything else happen.

12:18.946 --> 12:20.281
I'm at my wit's end.

12:33.127 --> 12:36.881
Hey, everyone! Choi I-ra is moving!

12:41.177 --> 12:42.678
Whoo-hoo!

12:42.762 --> 12:43.596
That's right.

12:47.641 --> 12:50.686
- Samba!
- Yeah, to the front! To the back!

12:51.437 --> 12:53.564
To the left. To the right.
To the front. To the back.

12:53.647 --> 12:54.899
Hey, look. Is that the cute guy!

12:54.982 --> 12:56.484
- Oh, hey, cute guy!
- I wanna see!

12:56.567 --> 12:59.195
- Hello.
- Hey, cute guy, looking hot!

12:59.278 --> 13:01.155
- We're in pj's!
- It's the cute guy.

13:01.238 --> 13:02.406
- Oh, hey!
- Hi!

13:04.784 --> 13:06.076
How've you guys been?!

13:07.536 --> 13:09.455
Uh, Yun-taek, what's happening?

13:09.538 --> 13:11.874
We had a vacancy here,
and she really needed a place to stay.

13:11.957 --> 13:13.876
Great, right?

13:13.959 --> 13:15.628
- Hey!
- Yay!

13:15.711 --> 13:17.755
Wow, how great is this? Welcome!

13:17.838 --> 13:19.965
Great choice! Hey, cute guy!

13:20.049 --> 13:21.509
Ah!

13:24.136 --> 13:25.596
- No way!
- From Dream Sweet!

13:25.679 --> 13:27.640
That's Lee Doona from Dream Sweet!

13:27.723 --> 13:30.351
Oh my gosh, it's Lee Doona!
It's Lee Doona! Oh wow!

13:30.434 --> 13:31.769
- Jeez! I can't even!
- Hello!

13:32.478 --> 13:34.104
So pretty.

13:34.939 --> 13:36.690
- So pretty!
- Totally gorgeous!

13:36.774 --> 13:38.734
- Gorgeous!
- Won-jun.

13:40.528 --> 13:41.570
Just look at her.

13:45.157 --> 13:47.117
Oh! She made it already.

13:55.501 --> 13:56.669
Thank you so much, sir.

14:01.841 --> 14:04.635
She left home, so I told her to come over.
I did good, right?

14:12.142 --> 14:14.937
- Hey, Yun-taek
- Hey, could you please take this from me?

14:15.020 --> 14:16.856
- Put it there.
- Leave it here?

14:16.939 --> 14:18.148
Wait, put it here!

14:18.232 --> 14:20.651
Not over there! It looks better here!
I just told you that.

14:20.734 --> 14:21.902
Seriously, listen to me, okay?

14:21.986 --> 14:23.195
Hey! Seriously!

14:23.279 --> 14:26.615
- Let go. Let go.
- Yun-taek, just put that here for now!

14:27.324 --> 14:28.826
Won-jun, wait for me!

14:28.909 --> 14:31.120
What on Earth are you wearing?

14:31.203 --> 14:32.788
- Pajamas?
- Aren't they cute?

14:32.872 --> 14:35.416
I decided to give a pair
to each of my new roommates.

14:35.499 --> 14:36.500
I'm flexing here.

14:37.376 --> 14:38.377
Would you like one?

14:38.961 --> 14:40.421
I'll pass, thanks.

14:40.504 --> 14:42.047
Oh, you know you want a pair.

14:42.923 --> 14:43.757
Hmm.

14:45.509 --> 14:46.886
- Hey.
- What?

14:47.678 --> 14:49.722
What's the deal with my new friend Doona?

14:50.347 --> 14:52.933
- Shouldn't you address her as your elder?
- No, why would I do that?

14:53.017 --> 14:54.226
I'm the same age as her.

14:54.310 --> 14:57.187
Would you give me some intel?
I have to live with her.

14:57.938 --> 14:59.815
Like, what kind of girl is she?
Is she crazy?

15:00.900 --> 15:02.443
I really have no idea,

15:03.235 --> 15:05.029
nor what's going on inside her head.

15:07.990 --> 15:09.700
We are here!

15:10.701 --> 15:11.785
Hey, you guys!

15:11.869 --> 15:13.412
We're back! Ah.

15:16.498 --> 15:19.710
- Oh, you bought beer.
- It's time for us to get wasted tonight!

15:19.793 --> 15:21.170
- I'll take one.
- Here you go.

15:21.253 --> 15:23.172
This is heavy.
How did you carry it?

15:23.255 --> 15:24.757
I used the manservant upstairs.

15:25.466 --> 15:27.051
What? You wanna come in too?

15:27.134 --> 15:29.803
- Um, no, it's okay.
- I wasn't gonna let you in anyway.

15:29.887 --> 15:31.847
You're an outcast now. You got that?

15:32.348 --> 15:33.641
You must know Kooksu too?

15:33.724 --> 15:35.517
- Of course I know Kooksu! Yes!
- Oh, you do?

15:35.601 --> 15:37.519
Oh, by the way,
he's inherited the business.

15:37.603 --> 15:38.896
- He's the CEO now!
- No way!

15:38.979 --> 15:41.106
Ugh, that lucky son of a gun!

15:41.190 --> 15:43.150
- You're annoyed!
- So not fair!

15:43.233 --> 15:45.778
- So his name is Kooksu?
- His name is Su-jin!

15:45.861 --> 15:48.447
Jinx! Jinx again! Jinx!

15:49.239 --> 15:50.699
Kook Su-jin, right?

15:50.783 --> 15:53.160
- Yup. Kooksu is really funny, isn't he?
- He really is.

15:54.161 --> 15:56.497
So then,
you must know Happy Pharmacy.

15:56.580 --> 15:57.998
Of course! They're still open.

15:58.082 --> 16:00.000
- No way, seriously?
- For sure!

16:00.084 --> 16:01.627
- Hmm, I loved it there.
- Really?

16:01.710 --> 16:04.088
Back then, Kooksu and I
would go there together

16:04.171 --> 16:06.590
because he had a huge crush
on the owner's beautiful daughter,

16:06.674 --> 16:09.051
and he bought so many energy drinks,
he got addicted!

16:09.134 --> 16:12.554
And Won-jun, as his trusty sidekick,
ended up getting addicted with him!

16:12.638 --> 16:14.223
What idiots!

16:14.306 --> 16:16.475
They were always
walking around like zombies!

16:31.490 --> 16:32.741
What brings you out?

16:33.409 --> 16:35.411
I-ra's on the phone with her mother now.

16:45.629 --> 16:47.881
It must be weird for you
to have roommates living with you.

16:47.965 --> 16:48.924
Mm-mm.

16:50.217 --> 16:52.094
I've lived in dorms before, you know.

16:53.178 --> 16:54.179
It must be hard for you.

16:54.263 --> 16:58.142
Mmm. Well, um, no.
It feels like I'm on a school trip.

16:58.225 --> 17:00.519
Is that what it feels like?

17:01.562 --> 17:03.981
I never got to experience
a school trip at all.

17:05.691 --> 17:08.569
Well, then the three of us
should plan a trip together one day soon.

17:08.652 --> 17:10.654
We could even wear school uniforms.

17:11.572 --> 17:13.032
Sounds good.

17:24.293 --> 17:26.086
I have a question for you.

17:26.795 --> 17:28.881
Why did you want
roommates so suddenly, huh?

17:30.090 --> 17:30.924
And you?

17:32.426 --> 17:34.344
Why did you move out
of your home so suddenly?

17:34.970 --> 17:36.555
I think it was just the timing.

17:38.140 --> 17:40.184
All the things that could go wrong did.

17:41.894 --> 17:44.146
That mixed with everything else going on

17:44.813 --> 17:48.650
all led to a final breaking point for me
that I just knew it was time for a change

17:48.734 --> 17:51.487
and I had to leave.
That's how it all transpired.

17:53.489 --> 17:55.199
I'm trying to stick up for myself.

18:00.537 --> 18:02.581
I confessed to Won-jun
how I felt about him.

18:05.292 --> 18:06.960
- Is that so?
- Yes.

18:07.961 --> 18:10.172
Not directly,
but it was enough for him to, uh,

18:10.964 --> 18:13.050
get the picture of how I really feel.

18:18.680 --> 18:21.100
That's why I'm here.
To wait out his answer.

18:22.684 --> 18:25.521
- This time I don't want to lose him.
- What are we to do?

18:29.108 --> 18:31.401
Well, despite the fact
I let you rent a room here,

18:32.861 --> 18:35.280
I can't root for you and Won-jun
in that regard,

18:35.823 --> 18:38.075
because now, I've also gotten involved.

18:50.212 --> 18:51.046
Doona,

18:55.050 --> 18:56.593
I know Won-jun very well.

18:57.094 --> 18:59.680
He always overthinks things
before doing them.

19:01.598 --> 19:04.560
He's always really cautious
about making big decisions, and, um,

19:04.643 --> 19:07.896
he doesn't get involved
with anything unstable or precarious.

19:07.980 --> 19:11.024
It makes him uncomfortable
because he doesn't want to get hurt.

19:11.859 --> 19:15.154
We've known each other for a long time.
We were very close.

19:16.530 --> 19:17.990
We had feelings for each other.

19:21.201 --> 19:23.078
It was really special for us.

19:28.125 --> 19:31.003
Ugh, we're late! Let's run!
I have a lecture first period!

19:31.086 --> 19:32.796
We're gonna be late anyway.

19:32.880 --> 19:35.549
No! No, come back!
Here. Hold your girlfriend.

19:35.632 --> 19:38.093
Listen, all of my stuff is so heavy.
Can't we just take a taxi?

19:38.177 --> 19:39.052
No way. Let go!

19:39.136 --> 19:40.387
How much stuff are you carrying?

19:40.470 --> 19:43.515
Whatever. You should carry it!
Here! Let's go.

19:43.599 --> 19:46.351
- Nope!
- What's your problem, you jerk?

19:46.435 --> 19:48.312
Don't throw my stuff!
What's wrong with you?

19:49.062 --> 19:50.981
It was really special for us.

19:51.648 --> 19:53.734
We spent our teenage years together.

19:54.860 --> 19:56.653
We were so close,
we could take on the world.

19:57.404 --> 19:59.948
So we have a connection unlike any other,
you know?

20:00.991 --> 20:03.035
That's a really powerful thing to have.

20:05.454 --> 20:07.456
So that's what I'm putting my faith into.

20:09.541 --> 20:12.002
- Look, we should eat first.
- Ow! That hurts!

20:12.085 --> 20:13.712
- Ow, ow!
- Ah! Hold on!

20:13.795 --> 20:15.923
- What are you doing?
- Sorry. Ow!

20:16.006 --> 20:17.132
Ugh, seriously!

20:18.884 --> 20:20.510
- Hey!
- Come on, guys.

20:20.594 --> 20:22.679
- Wait up!
- Go! Go! Go!

20:23.513 --> 20:24.723
Hey, Won-jun!

20:30.145 --> 20:32.648
Hey, so how's it going
living with a celebrity?

20:32.731 --> 20:33.732
Are you guys friends yet?

20:33.815 --> 20:36.902
And what's her personality like?
Because her reputation sucks.

20:36.985 --> 20:39.321
Pretty sure she's like anyone else.

20:39.404 --> 20:41.782
So what about all the men, huh?

20:45.369 --> 20:46.453
Oh, that.

20:48.956 --> 20:51.458
- What's the face for?
- What's with your nostrils? What is it?

20:51.541 --> 20:52.668
You're scaring me.

21:00.550 --> 21:02.344
Actually, to be honest…

21:02.928 --> 21:04.304
So earlier this morning, uh…

21:04.388 --> 21:05.305
Uh-huh.

21:14.356 --> 21:15.857
MEN
CLOSE THE CURTAIN BEFORE SHOWERING

21:17.401 --> 21:18.318
Oh.

21:41.842 --> 21:42.968
I-ra Choi!

21:45.721 --> 21:47.306
- Marry him!
- Ha!

21:47.389 --> 21:48.682
- Marry him!
- Ha!

21:48.765 --> 21:50.267
- Marry him!
- Ah!

21:57.899 --> 21:59.776
The kiss gave me butterflies.

22:02.529 --> 22:05.365
And I don't want to feel
that way over nothing, all right?

23:15.477 --> 23:18.730
Be careful when you're alone
in a crowd. It's obvious.

23:21.733 --> 23:23.652
What do you mean? What's obvious?

23:24.986 --> 23:26.279
Your loneliness.

23:27.322 --> 23:30.951
Your desperation to be loved,
to try to compensate for never having it.

23:31.910 --> 23:34.037
You're afraid of losing people's interest.

23:43.630 --> 23:47.134
- Samba girl, I-ra Choi!
- The kissing king, Yun-taek!

23:47.217 --> 23:48.218
Mmm.

23:50.846 --> 23:52.973
Why are you so giddy?

23:53.056 --> 23:55.642
Who's the girl you like?

23:55.725 --> 23:57.811
- Thank you for feeding us.
- Mm-hmm.

23:58.311 --> 24:01.356
- I can help clean if you want.
- Oh, no, that's okay. I got it. Thanks.

24:04.276 --> 24:05.819
Hey, could I borrow a blanket from you?

24:05.902 --> 24:08.655
Uh, there's… there's
a blanket in my room you can borrow.

24:08.738 --> 24:09.614
Ah.

24:10.615 --> 24:11.575
Thank you so much.

24:11.658 --> 24:12.617
Hmm.

24:28.633 --> 24:30.343
THE ART OF MATHEMATICS

25:31.988 --> 25:34.324
- Did you find it?
- Uh-huh.

25:37.285 --> 25:39.454
- Come have a drink with us then.
- Mm-hmm.

25:58.014 --> 26:01.351
- Wasn't that someone famous?
- Did I gasp way too loud?

26:03.645 --> 26:06.106
She's from Dream Sweet.
Dream Sweet.

26:07.023 --> 26:09.025
I didn't know she goes clubbing.

26:21.705 --> 26:23.915
- Don't you know who I am?
- Huh?!

26:25.417 --> 26:26.668
You're Lee Doona!

26:36.344 --> 26:37.846
I'm honored.

26:37.929 --> 26:41.933
A huge idol star like yourself approaching
a washed-up former teen idol like me.

26:42.851 --> 26:45.729
Yeah, it's kind of like
when you meet another Korean

26:45.812 --> 26:47.939
that's traveling the globe
and you run into them.

26:49.107 --> 26:52.235
And now you're even prettier, huh?
What are you up to these days?

26:52.319 --> 26:53.194
Nothing much, really.

26:55.238 --> 26:58.199
It's too bad what went down.
And at the height of your career.

26:59.451 --> 27:02.412
- Yeah, I screwed it all up. So what?
- Yeah.

27:02.912 --> 27:05.040
You know, I bet
if I was given a chance again,

27:05.123 --> 27:06.666
I could handle this industry shit.

27:06.750 --> 27:10.045
Although, I'm told
there's always some new shit to handle.

27:10.879 --> 27:12.380
I feel for you.

27:12.464 --> 27:14.257
Hmm.

27:16.551 --> 27:19.179
- You wanna head out?
- Sure, why not?

27:20.138 --> 27:21.681
People are, you know…

27:22.515 --> 27:25.977
Well, they're designed to…
to instinctively recognize others

27:26.061 --> 27:27.729
that are similar to themselves.

27:27.812 --> 27:30.315
- Take I-ra Choi here.
- Uh-huh!

27:30.398 --> 27:34.194
The moment I saw her,
I knew right away that she was totally

27:34.277 --> 27:36.154
my kind of person, hey?

27:36.237 --> 27:39.032
- That's why we mesh so well, right?
- You're so nice, Yun-taek! Ah!

27:39.115 --> 27:42.577
Jin-ju and Won-jun,
is it exactly the same for you guys?

27:42.661 --> 27:44.954
Like, birds of a feather? Huh?

27:45.038 --> 27:45.872
Right, guys?

27:51.670 --> 27:53.380
- Uh, so…
- Hmm.

27:53.463 --> 27:55.340
- Yay!
- Yay, yay! Here.

27:55.423 --> 27:56.591
- Uh… to the king!
- To the king!

27:56.675 --> 27:58.343
Yeah!Uh…

27:58.426 --> 28:00.220
- Ugh! Seriously?!
- Stop complaining.

28:00.303 --> 28:02.138
- I'm sorry.
- Come on.

28:02.222 --> 28:04.683
I can carry her, okay? I'll carry her.

28:04.766 --> 28:06.810
- Open the door, will you?
- Open what door?

28:06.893 --> 28:08.103
Oh, this door.

28:08.186 --> 28:11.189
- Jeez, this girl is so weird.
- Hey, be quiet, will you?

28:11.272 --> 28:12.607
Stop it!

28:12.691 --> 28:14.109
Wanna take a walk?

28:14.192 --> 28:15.902
Keep going.

28:15.985 --> 28:17.612
- Um…
- Let's go now.

28:17.696 --> 28:19.989
I could carry her
with one hand. Trust me.

28:39.300 --> 28:40.301
Oh!

28:40.385 --> 28:41.219
Look.

28:42.262 --> 28:43.263
I wanna try it.

28:47.142 --> 28:47.976
Uh…

29:09.330 --> 29:10.165
Leave it alone.

29:13.626 --> 29:14.586
It's broken, Jin-ju.

29:21.760 --> 29:23.178
OUT OF ORDER!
DO NOT INSERT COINS!

29:23.261 --> 29:25.138
I thought I'd sooner die than

29:25.221 --> 29:28.433
actually tell you about
what was going on with my family.

29:30.602 --> 29:31.603
Just so you know,

29:33.438 --> 29:35.440
I was really happy that day.

29:36.691 --> 29:39.402
The guy I really liked
finally told me that he was into me.

29:39.486 --> 29:40.403
I was on cloud nine.

29:52.874 --> 29:54.000
I really like you.

29:56.461 --> 29:58.797
My heart felt
like it was about to burst.

29:58.880 --> 30:01.007
I felt like I got everything I wanted.

30:01.508 --> 30:03.927
I was so happy,
I wanted to scream and shout.

30:13.686 --> 30:16.356
There were so many things
I wanted to do together.

30:19.025 --> 30:21.194
I felt we could do anything,
and I couldn't wait.

30:22.654 --> 30:23.613
Hey!

30:24.113 --> 30:27.408
Write down everything
you did with the guy! Do it now.

30:29.035 --> 30:31.871
I said now! I'll show you!
You defiant bitch!

30:31.955 --> 30:34.707
Honey, no! Just stop!
Stop! Stop it!

30:41.965 --> 30:44.008
It was like
falling out of a dream.

30:44.551 --> 30:46.427
I was suddenly back in reality.

30:49.097 --> 30:51.015
The Jin-ju that you really liked,

30:51.099 --> 30:52.517
well, that girl was

30:52.600 --> 30:55.895
always cheerful, appeared super confident,
and always had a smile.

30:56.896 --> 30:59.983
But I was actually hiding myself from you.
That wasn't real,

31:00.066 --> 31:03.069
because deep down,
I was miserable and had a troubled family.

31:07.782 --> 31:10.201
I didn't want you to know
what was going on, you know?

31:17.667 --> 31:19.752
Don't you have anything
you wanna tell me, Won-jun?

31:29.762 --> 31:30.722
I, uh…

31:33.057 --> 31:34.809
I really liked you a lot, Jin-ju.

31:56.539 --> 31:57.540
I, uh…

31:58.917 --> 32:00.335
I really liked you a lot, Jin-ju.

32:02.837 --> 32:05.131
So much so that I didn't want to see you

32:05.673 --> 32:07.425
in case I fell for you again.

32:08.426 --> 32:10.303
I was worried I would get hurt, you know?

32:11.888 --> 32:14.265
I kept my distance
so that when I saw you again,

32:15.016 --> 32:17.352
I would feel unsure whether or not, um,

32:18.311 --> 32:19.938
I ever had those feelings at all.

32:21.856 --> 32:24.192
I wish I could've been there
to comfort you

32:24.275 --> 32:26.945
when you were dealing with
the family issues, Jin-ju.

32:28.321 --> 32:29.238
But now,

32:31.407 --> 32:33.201
too much time has passed, I think.

32:34.661 --> 32:36.496
You could comfort me now.

32:37.747 --> 32:39.582
I still need it, you know? Hmm?

32:40.083 --> 32:43.711
Please give this a chance.
I still want your support, Won-jun.

32:43.795 --> 32:45.129
Huh?

32:45.213 --> 32:47.423
You can get there again.
It's still in you, hmm?

32:53.846 --> 32:55.598
We're talking about us here.

33:01.980 --> 33:02.897
I'm really sorry.

33:05.316 --> 33:07.443
The reason I wanted
to take a walk with you

33:08.194 --> 33:09.862
was to say it's different now.

34:31.402 --> 34:32.278
Good night.

34:37.784 --> 34:40.369
What the fuck?
What do you think you're doing?

34:44.457 --> 34:45.750
Ah.

34:46.501 --> 34:48.753
So that's how you mess with guys.

34:48.836 --> 34:50.588
I know a lot of people can't stand you.

34:51.172 --> 34:52.548
And now I totally get it.

34:53.674 --> 34:55.384
Yeah? How about you get lost, huh?

34:56.803 --> 34:58.971
You do this all for his attention,
don't you?

35:03.976 --> 35:05.311
Where's your manager now?

35:07.939 --> 35:09.023
Sucks for you, doesn't it?

35:09.899 --> 35:11.984
I heard he cut you off completely.
Isn't that right?

35:15.863 --> 35:17.073
Everything okay?

35:18.282 --> 35:20.159
Who are you supposed to be, huh?

35:23.579 --> 35:25.706
Is this who you're hanging out with?
Seriously?

35:26.415 --> 35:27.416
You…

35:29.544 --> 35:31.379
- Tell me, how old are you?
- What about you, huh?

35:31.462 --> 35:32.880
What did you say, shithead?

35:34.006 --> 35:37.093
Hey. I left my phone in your car.

35:38.803 --> 35:40.304
I'll get it for you.

35:42.098 --> 35:43.224
Let's go get it.

35:49.272 --> 35:50.648
Unbelievable.

36:02.577 --> 36:06.080
- Ah… boy…
- Are you her friend?

36:06.164 --> 36:07.039
What?

36:07.123 --> 36:09.542
I said, "Are you her friend or what?"

36:12.795 --> 36:15.047
Man, that girl doesn't have any friends.

36:17.341 --> 36:20.428
I'm in the same position you are, kid.
She's a lot.

36:21.053 --> 36:24.265
You know,
it's really not even funny, but…

36:24.348 --> 36:27.059
…she'll pounce on anyone
just to get that prick's attention.

36:27.143 --> 36:28.728
I'm talking about her manager, huh?

36:29.228 --> 36:31.022
If she's that desperate, then I'll do it.

36:31.105 --> 36:33.524
I'll give her what she wants.
Everyone wins, right?

36:37.028 --> 36:38.946
What? Wanna punch me? Go ahead.

36:41.449 --> 36:42.783
I think you need to leave.

36:44.285 --> 36:47.038
Why? You think you're different?

36:47.997 --> 36:50.291
What, are you fucking
in love with her or something?

36:50.374 --> 36:51.918
Yikes.

36:54.837 --> 36:57.715
Ah! Fuck!

37:00.927 --> 37:03.221
You asshole…

37:03.971 --> 37:06.390
Ah.

37:37.213 --> 37:39.548
I wanna know what goes on
in that mind of yours.

37:44.387 --> 37:45.930
You're really something, you know that?

38:52.413 --> 38:54.123
It's okay to feel like that.

38:54.206 --> 38:57.585
Everyone does at first, then gets over it.
You won't be any different, all right?

39:12.183 --> 39:14.185
Why are you out here?

39:31.869 --> 39:32.995
You're so sweaty.

39:33.079 --> 39:34.372
Fix your hair. Here.

39:41.337 --> 39:42.171
What?

39:43.089 --> 39:44.131
Is it off-limits?

39:47.385 --> 39:48.761
You getting fuzzy feelings?

39:55.893 --> 39:56.852
I suck at dribbling.

40:20.876 --> 40:21.710
Hey!

40:46.360 --> 40:48.112
I wanna ask you
something about what you said.

40:51.282 --> 40:53.200
Just who am I no different from, huh?

40:53.909 --> 40:55.953
That guy from tonight? If not, then who?

40:59.081 --> 41:00.583
I guess you forgot what you said.

41:01.375 --> 41:04.462
You told me you didn't want
to feel this way… over nothing.

41:04.545 --> 41:05.963
Sure, I didn't refute it,

41:06.547 --> 41:08.299
because I was worried you were right.

41:11.510 --> 41:14.430
That's why I tried to meet someone else
at the club tonight, okay?

41:15.222 --> 41:16.807
I wanted to test my feelings.

41:18.476 --> 41:19.768
Whether they were real or not.

41:20.853 --> 41:22.980
I wanted to know
how much I really liked you…

41:25.107 --> 41:27.735
and that I wasn't just trying
to get a man to obsess over me.

41:30.613 --> 41:32.573
If I have fallen for you, then what next?

41:34.617 --> 41:37.244
If I told you that even when I'm
surrounded by other people,

41:37.328 --> 41:38.913
that I only want you, Won-jun,

41:38.996 --> 41:40.664
that I find myself missing you
every minute…

41:44.001 --> 41:46.170
If I say
I've completely fallen in love with you…

41:48.172 --> 41:49.673
then what will you do?

41:58.057 --> 41:59.642
Hmm. See what I mean?

42:00.893 --> 42:02.561
You're right. This is meaningless.

42:37.263 --> 42:38.931
I thought you didn't kiss your friends.

42:40.683 --> 42:41.559
I don't.
